{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ff78ef1c-9c98-863f-a55d-b77c9eb970d4",
  "created_at": "2026-01-30T15:41:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carlos Andrade",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:37:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:37:30-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Lorraine. Carlos Andrade here. Yeah, my trash didn't get picked up this week. Usually it's Thursday for us and the barrel was out at the curb at six in the morning, and it's still sitting there full."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:37:51-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Thursday pickup, and the barrel's still at the curb as of today, Friday. Did you see the truck come down your street at all, or do you think they skipped it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:38:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Didn't see it. I left for work around seven. My neighbor's barrel is still out too, so I don't think it's just me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:38:22-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. So your neighbor's wasn't picked up either. That helps. Let me ask, is it regular trash or was it recycling day too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:38:35-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just regular trash this week. Recycling is the other week, I think. Hang on, sorry, I'm peeling a label off a pickle jar here. It's stuck on like it's welded. Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:38:54-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're fine. Take your time. Those labels are the worst. Did the barrel have the lid closed, and was it out by the road and not up on a snowbank or anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:39:13-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lid closed, right at the edge of the driveway, handle facing the house. Same as always. No snowbank, the plows haven't been by in a while."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:39:28-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Then it sounds like the route got missed or ran late. I'll put in a note for the crew supervisor that Thursday's trash wasn't collected on your street. Can I get your street name, so I log it right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:39:51-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I'd rather not give the address on this call. I just want to know when the next pickup is. Is it next Thursday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:40:05-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I understand. Without the address I can't pull your exact route, but if you're Thursday, then your next regular pickup would be next Thursday. Some missed routes get made up over the weekend or Saturday, so I'd leave the barrel out for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:40:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leave it out through the weekend, so, in case they come back around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:40:38-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Leave it at the curb, and if it's still there Monday morning, give us another call and we'll get it flagged for a special pickup. Does that work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:40:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that works. And if they don't come Saturday, then next Thursday is the regular one. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:41:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Next Thursday regular, possible makeup this weekend, call back Monday if nothing happens. Anything else I can do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:41:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Okay, finally got the label off. Thanks, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:41:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Carlos. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:41:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
